1
00:05:18,750 --> 00:05:24,750
Engaging Father Christmas is a tv movie, romance,
drama film directed by David Winning.

2
00:10:37,500 --> 00:10:43,500
It's Christmas and Miranda leaves Seattle with a suitcase full of presents to join her long- lost family
in Carlton Heath, where she will experience the joyful traditions she missed as a child.

3
00:15:56,250 --> 00:16:02,250
Last Christmas, Miranda fell in love with Ian, a local man who helped her as she searched for her
father, James Whitcomb, a famous theatre actor she believed had a connection to the town.

4
00:21:15,000 --> 00:21:21,000
At his widow Margaret’s request, Miranda agrees to keep it a
secret to protect the family from scandal.

5
00:26:33,750 --> 00:26:39,750
Miranda Carson Chester, played by Erin Krakow.

6
00:31:52,500 --> 00:31:58,500
Ian McAndrick, played by Niall Matter.

7
00:37:11,250 --> 00:37:17,250
Margaret Whitcomb, played by Wendie Malick.

8
00:42:30,000 --> 00:42:36,000
